B: I''m still not sure, Amy. I''m torn between the drama club and the football club.
A: Well, you always loved acting in junior high. Why not try drama?
B: That''s true. I once hoped I would perform on a real stage one day.
A: Then go for it! The drama club meets every Wednesday afternoon in Room 204.
B: Great. What about you? Which club are you choosing?
A: I''ve already joined the school newspaper. I want to interview new students.
B: That sounds fun. Maybe you can interview me after my first performance!', 'Amy 问 Ben 这学期想加入哪个社团;Ben 在戏剧社和足球社之间难以抉择;Amy 提醒他初中就爱表演,建议选戏剧社;Ben 想起曾希望有天能登台;Amy 告诉他戏剧社每周三下午在204室;Amy 自己已加入校报,想采访新生;Ben 开玩笑说等他演出后可来采访他。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which two clubs is Ben torn between?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The drama club and the football club.","The music club and the art club.","The newspaper club and the drama club.","The football club and the chess club."]},{"q":"Why does Amy suggest the drama club for Ben?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It is the easiest club to join.","He has always loved acting since junior high.","It meets on Friday evenings.","His parents told him to."]},{"q":"When and where does the drama club meet?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Wednesday afternoon in Room 204.","Monday morning in the library.","Friday afternoon in the hall.","Tuesday evening in Room 102."]},{"q":"Which club has Amy already joined?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The football club.","The school newspaper.","The drama club.","The art club."]},{"q":"What does Ben joke about at the end?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Quitting all the clubs.","Joining the newspaper too.","Being interviewed after his first performance.","Missing the first meeting."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1', 'sufe');
B: Sure. Which class are you in?
A: Class One, Grade Ten. It''s my first day, so I''m a bit lost.
B: Don''t worry, that''s quite normal. Your room is on the second floor, Room 201.
A: Thank you so much. How do I get to the second floor?
B: Take the stairs at the end of this corridor, then turn left. You''ll see it right away.
A: That''s very kind of you. I was afraid I''d be late on my very first morning.
B: You''ve got plenty of time. Welcome to our school, and good luck!', '一名新生找不到教室向人求助;对方问他在哪个班;新生说高一(1)班,第一天有点迷路;对方安慰说很正常,教室在二楼201室;新生问怎么上二楼;对方指引走走廊尽头的楼梯然后左转就能看到;新生感谢并说怕第一天就迟到;对方说时间还很充裕,欢迎来到学校并祝好运。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is the new student''s problem?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He cannot find his classroom.","He has lost his schoolbag.","He missed the school bus.","He forgot his homework."]},{"q":"Which class is the new student in?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Class Two, Grade Nine.","Class One, Grade Ten.","Class Three, Grade Ten.","Class One, Grade Eleven."]},{"q":"Where is the student''s classroom?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["On the first floor, Room 101.","In the library.","On the second floor, Room 201.","Next to the office."]},{"q":"How should the student reach the second floor?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Take the lift and turn right.","Walk straight out of the building.","Ask the head teacher first.","Take the stairs at the end of the corridor and turn left."]},{"q":"Why was the new student worried?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He was afraid of being late on his first morning.","He had no friends at all.","He disliked the school food.","He had lost his timetable."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1', 'sufe');
B: Yes! The school library is wonderful. I loved it the first time I visited.
A: Really? What makes it so attractive to you?
B: It''s quiet and comfortable, with plants, nice desks and modern facilities.
A: That does sound lovely. Was it easy to borrow books there?
B: Very easy. The self-service system let me borrow a book in just five minutes.
A: Amazing! So would you say the library is your favourite place so far?
B: Definitely. I feel totally relaxed whenever I study or read there.', '校报记者李梅采访一名新生,问校园新生活有什么令人兴奋的;新生说图书馆很棒,第一次去就爱上了;李梅问它为何如此吸引人;新生说安静舒适,有绿植、好桌椅和现代设施;李梅问借书是否方便;新生说很方便,自助系统五分钟就借到一本书;李梅问图书馆是否是他目前最爱的地方;新生肯定回答,说在那里学习阅读都感到完全放松。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Who is Li Mei?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A new student.","The head teacher.","A reporter from the school newspaper.","The librarian."]},{"q":"What does the new student like best about school?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["The football field.","The dining hall.","The computer room.","The school library."]},{"q":"What makes the library attractive to the student?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is quiet and comfortable with modern facilities.","It is large but very noisy.","It has no books at all.","It is open only at night."]},{"q":"How long did it take to borrow a book?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A whole afternoon.","About five minutes with the self-service system.","Three days.","It was not possible to borrow any."]},{"q":"How does the student feel when reading in the library?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Quite bored.","Very nervous.","Totally relaxed.","Rather angry."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1', 'sufe');

